# Batch [A] part 2 (0.4.3): from fm1-build-status.md. Boards of Canada's chords and lead warble (SFX_WARBLE),
# Autechre's drums drift over the Grids map (SFX_DRIFT; the grid below is for the other drum settings), Aphex's 303
# cutoff drifts over 8 bars (the wobble's slow rate).

style APHEX
kick     X... ..x. .... x...
snare    .... X... .... X...
chat     x.x. xxx. x.x. x.xx
cowbell  .... .... ..x. ....
tom      .... .... .... .x.x

style BOC
kick     X... ..x. X... ....
snare    .... X... .... X...
rim      .... .... ..o. ....
chat     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.

style AUTECHRE
kick     X..x ..x. .x.. x...
snare    .... X..x .... ..X.
chat     xoox oxoo xoox oxoo
tom      ..x. .... ...x ....
claves   .x.. x... ..x. .x..

style WARP
kick     X... X... X... X...
rim      .... ..o. .... ..o.
chat     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.
claves   .... .... ...o ....
